OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Listening to the Planet
OL,6,     FChris Watson meets wetlands
OL,7,     Fmanager Jo Geddes to explore the
OL,8,     Fsonic heartbeat of southern
OL,9,     FAustralia's swamps, with froglet
OL,10,     Fcalls and rare crane chirrups.
OL,11,G2200 Late Junction
OL,12,     FJennifer Lucy Allan serves up
OL,13,     Fwonderfully wonky sounds for
OL,14,     Fadventurous ears, from Finnish
OL,15,     Ffree jazz and Pakistani raags to
OL,16,     Fspoken-word chamber pop and
OL,17,     Fleftfield opera.
