OL,5,G2330 'Round Midnight
OL,6,     FSoweto is joined by
OL,7,     FMalaysian-Australian DJ and
OL,8,     Fproducer Norsicaa as his Friday
OL,9,     Fnight guest. She has curated a
OL,10,     F30-minute mixtape featuring some
OL,11,     Fof her favourite jazz cuts.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FThe Swedish Radio Choir, conductor
OL,14,     FKaspars Putnins, soprano Lisa
OL,15,     FCarlioth, bass Lars Johansson
OL,16,     FBrissman and pianists Roland
OL,17,     FPontinen and Love Derwinger
OL,18,     Fperform Brahms's German Requiem.
